A description-hosted note's floor is its own marker plus two

```
:: t
:  [^f]: note
     - nested
tail
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd></dd>
</dl>
<p>tail</p>
```

```
:: t
:  [^f]: note
     b
tail
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd></dd>
</dl>
<p>tail</p>
```

```
:: t
:  [^f]: note
    - nested
tail
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>
    <ul>
      <li>nested
tail</li>
    </ul>
  </dd>
</dl>
```

```
:: t
:  [^f]: note
     - nested
   tail
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>tail</dd>
</dl>
```
